  "_implementation_notes": [
    "SILPH CO. 11F (MAP 807) -- THE FORK",
    "",
    "This file implements the pivotal Synthesis choice on Silph Co 11F.",
    "The player decides whether to fight Giovanni (Oak Path) or chase",
    "the Master Ball while Blue handles Giovanni (Giovanni Path).",
    "",
    "MECHANICAL CHANGES:",
    "  Event 4 (Giovanni battle):",
    "    - Rewrite pre-battle dialogue with Synthesis tone",
    "    - replace_commands 28-58: replaces entire battle sequence with",
    "      a branching version based on player choice",
    "    - Oak Path: ROCKETBOSS Giovanni battle (same trainer call)",
    "    - Giovanni Path: ROCKETEXEC_M Archer battle (existing trainer)",
    "    - Sets Switch 1130 (SYNTH_FORK_CHOSEN) = ON after battle",
    "    - Oak Path: Switch 1131 stays OFF (default)",
    "    - Giovanni Path: Switch 1131 = ON",
    "",
    "  Event 8 (giovanni-controller cutscene):",
    "    - Rewrite Giovanni/chairman dialogue with Synthesis framing",
    "    - No structural changes",
    "",
    "  Event 10 (Blue post-battle):",
    "    - replace_commands 4-20: replaces all dialogue with",
    "      conditional branch on Switch 1131 (path fork)",
    "    - Giovanni Path (1131 ON): Blue fought Giovanni, asks",
    "      about the Master Ball, questions whether it was right",
    "    - Oak Path (1131 OFF): Blue grabbed the Master Ball,",
    "      you beat Giovanni, Blue reflects on bigger picture",
    "    - Both paths: League/Saffron Gym/surf advice + farewell",
    "",
    "PRESERVED: All movement routes, partner removal, switch logic",
    "(222/228/628/629/630/191). Screen fade and SE replaced with",
    "equivalent script calls (pbSEPlay, pbFadeOutIn).",
    "",
    "RPG Maker switch values: [id, id, 0]=ON, [id, id, 1]=OFF",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line."
